  "level": 0,
  "ordinal": 0,
  "summary": "Main\nTanker rates have hit record highs this week. VLCC earnings are now averaging over USD 600,000 p/d globally,with rates near Hormuz reaching as high as USD 800,000-1.5 million p/d. This is being driven by a surge in oil shuttled through the Strait via ship-to-ship transfers, now above 7.5 million barrels a day, as Saudi Arabia routes more crude through the Gulf.",
